   <indicator ascending="1" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement in service quality as measured by: (i) increase in end user voltage; and (ii) improved customer satisfaction.</narrative>
    </title>
    <baseline iso-date="2007-10-31" value="(i)  190 volts  (ii)  35%" year="2007">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Baseline for the second sub-indicator reflects Tanesco&apos;s customer survey results of 2009 since no study was available beforethat year.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2007-10-31"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2015-03-31"></period-end>
     <target value="(ii)  &amp;gt;218 volts  (ii) &amp;gt;75% after Baseline Survey"></target>
     <actual value="(i) 190 volts  (ii) 40%">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">With regard to sub-indicator (i) progress has yet to be reported since related works and goods are at early stage of implementationno. With regard to sub-indic                                                    ator (ii) Tanesco provided the Mission with theresults of their recent customer                                                     survey and annual targets an indcator valueshave now been agreed. Since the Ba                                                    seline Value year this sub-indicator hasslightly improved from 35% to 40%. More                                                     details in the attached AM.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
